flowchart TD
  A[Incoming request] --> B{Explicit route?}
  B -- No --> E[404/405 Problem Details]
  B -- Yes --> C{Limiter available and allows?}
  C -- No, exhausted --> F[429 + Retry-After]
  C -- No, unavailable --> G[503 for protected policy]
  C -- Yes --> D{Protected route valid token/scope?}
  D -- No --> H[401/403 Problem Details]
  D -- Yes --> I{Upstream within bounded timeout?}
  I -- No --> J[503/504 Problem Details]
  I -- Yes --> K[Response with correlation]
